		<item>
			<title>Lil' Buck is Madonna's New Dancer</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/246-lil-buck-is-madonnas-new-dancer.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/246-lil-buck-is-madonnas-new-dancer.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p><strong>Lil' Buck</strong> is officially <strong>Madonna's new dancer</strong> and will tour with her next year. He is the winner of the <strong>Smirnoff Nightlife Exchange Project's Global Dance Search</strong> that Madonna hold last night at the <strong>Roseland Ballroom</strong> in <strong>New York</strong>. <strong>DrownedMadonna.com</strong> gave you a live coverage on <a href="http://www.facebook.com/drownedmadonna" target="_blank">www.facebook.com/drownedmadonna</a>. It was very hard to sent updates being a very "insane" night!</p>
<p> </p>
<p><strong>Lil' Buck</strong> from Memphis was one of our favourite entries. We want to post again his video we posted on early September. Congratulation <strong>Lick</strong>!</p>
<p> </p>
<p>{youtube}p3ItZdTxjZU{/youtube}</p>
<p> </p>
<p>"This has been an incredible journey and a dream come true," said <strong>Lil' Buck</strong>.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>"<strong>The Smirnoff Nightlife Exchange Project</strong> has uncovered amazing dance talent from all over the world, but <strong>Lil' Buck</strong> was the best of all," added <strong>Madonna</strong>.</p>
<p> </p>
<p><img src="http://drownedmadonna.com/img/roseland/finalists.jpg" border="0" style="border: 0;" /></p></div><div class="K2FeedTags"><ul><li>Smirnoff</li><ul></div>]]></description>
			<category>Parties</category>
			<pubDate>Sun, 13 Nov 2011 11:33:27 +0000</pubDate>
		</item>
