		<item>
			<title>Live coverage from Madonna &amp; Smirnoff Party at Roseland Ballroom</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/241-live-coverage-from-madonna-smirnoff-party-at-roseland-ballroom.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/241-live-coverage-from-madonna-smirnoff-party-at-roseland-ballroom.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p><strong>DrownedMadonna.com</strong> collaborator <strong>Tony Albanese</strong> are doing his best to cover live tonight exclusive <strong>Madonna</strong> danceevent from <strong>New York's Roseland Ballroom</strong>.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>"Everyone keep checking the <a href="http://www.facebook.com/drownedmadonna" target="_blank">DrownedMadonna Facebook</a> page tonight (<a href="http://www.facebook.com/drownedmadonna" target="_blank">http://www.facebook.com/drownedmadonna</a>)," <strong>Tony</strong> says. "I will be doing real time updates and posting photos and videos throughout the evening. It promises to be a fun, unique night and I will take you along for the experience!" <strong>Please join our Facebook page.</strong></p>
<p> </p>
<p>We recommend to stay tuned also to <strong>DrownedMadonna newspage</strong>.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>People are about to enter the <strong>Roseland Ballroom</strong> now. Tonight <strong>Madonna</strong> is going to choose a <strong>dancer</strong> who will tour with her as well as performing with her at next year <strong>Super Bowl</strong>. <strong>Martin Solveig</strong> is attending and playing at the party.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>"The VIP line is insane," reports <strong>Tony</strong>. "But the GA line is even crazier!"</p>
<p> </p>
<p><img src="http://drownedmadonna.com/img/roseland/01.jpg" border="0" alt="people queuing for Madonna at Roseland Ballroom" width="790" height="1322" style="border: 0;" /></p>
<p> </p>
<p style="text-align: center;">People queuing outside the <strong>Roseland Ballroom</strong></p></div><div class="K2FeedTags"><ul><li>Smirnoff</li><ul></div>]]></description>
